{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A cloud file system backed by Box, using the Box Swift SDK ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxSdkGen"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/9Ensembles15CloudFileSystemP","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:12EnsemblesBox0B15CloudFileSystemC","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BoxCloudFileSystem"}],"symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BoxCloudFileSystem"}],"modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesBox"}],"title":"BoxCloudFileSystem"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/init(client:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/client","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/isConnected"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/connect()","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/contentsOfDirectory(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/createDirectory(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/downloadFile(atPath:toLocalFile:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/fetchUserIdentity()","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/fileExists(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/removeItem(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/uploadLocalFile(atPath:toPath:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/CloudFileSystem-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesbox\/boxcloudfilesystem"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BoxCloudFileSystem"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This backend requires the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/box\/box-ios-sdk.git","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package. With the source distribution, enable the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Box"},{"text":" package trait and SPM resolves it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"automatically. With the binary distribution (XCFrameworks), add BoxSDK as a separate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package dependency in your project.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","style":"important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Box uses numeric IDs rather than paths to identify files and folders. This backend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bridges the path-based "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol onto Box’s ID-based API by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walking the folder hierarchy to resolve Ensembles paths"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ensembleId\/events\/file.json"},{"type":"text","text":") to Box folder and file IDs."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Resolved IDs are cached in internal dictionaries to minimize API calls. The cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is invalidated when items are deleted or when not-found errors indicate stale entries."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app creates and configures a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxClient"},{"type":"text","text":" with its own authentication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and injects it at init time:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-token\")","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"Authentication","type":"heading","anchor":"Authentication","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Box Swift SDK supports multiple authentication methods. Create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxClient"},{"type":"text","text":" with the appropriate auth for your use case:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Developer Token (testing only)","type":"heading","anchor":"Developer-Token-testing-only","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get a short-lived token from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.box.com\/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under your app’s configuration page. These tokens expire after 60 minutes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-developer-token\")","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"OAuth 2.0 (production apps)","type":"heading","anchor":"OAuth-20-production-apps","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register your app at "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.box.com\/","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"developer.box.com","type":"text"}],"overridingTitle":"developer.box.com"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configure an OAuth 2.0 redirect URI:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let config = OAuthConfig(clientId: \"your-client-id\", clientSecret: \"your-secret\")","let auth = BoxOAuth(config: config)","\/\/ Call auth.authorize(url:) with your redirect URL after the OAuth flow","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"Client Credentials Grant (server-side)","type":"heading","anchor":"Client-Credentials-Grant-server-side","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For server-to-server integration without user interaction:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let config = CCGConfig(","    clientId: \"your-client-id\",","    clientSecret: \"your-secret\",","    userId: \"user-id\"",")","let auth = BoxCCGAuth(config: config)","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"Threading","type":"heading","anchor":"Threading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This class is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@unchecked Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":". The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxClient"},{"type":"text","text":" handles its own thread"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"safety internally. Mutable state (caches, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loggedIn"},{"type":"text","text":" flag) is accessed only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from async methods that are serialized by the ensemble’s operation queue."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://EnsemblesBox/documentation/EnsemblesBox":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A Box-based cloud backend for Ensembles.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"EnsemblesBox","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesbox"},"doc://EnsemblesBox/documentation/EnsemblesBox/BoxCloudFileSystem/fetchUserIdentity()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/fetchUserIdentity()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Fetches a token representing the current user of the cloud file system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Often this will be the user or login name.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fetchUserIdentity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> sending (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSCoding","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(pl)NSCoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" & ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSCopying","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(pl)NSCopying","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" & ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSObjectProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(pl)NSObject","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")?","kind":"text"}],"title":"fetchUserIdentity()","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesbox\/boxcloudfilesystem\/fetchuseridentity()"},"doc://EnsemblesBox/9Ensembles15CloudFileSystemP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/9Ensembles15CloudFileSystemP","title":"Ensembles.CloudFileSystem"},"doc://EnsemblesBox/documentation/EnsemblesBox/BoxCloudFileSystem":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem","type":"topic"